d 'FACTSHEETPLOT': module to apply standardized factsheet styling to graphs
d
d  factsheetplot applies a bundled graph scheme and standardized
d 8-by-5 dimensions to the current or a named Stata graph. It can
d also activate the scheme for graphs subsequently created in the
d current Stata session and optionally export the styled graph at a
d configurable pixel width. Explicit plot styling and the
d substantive content of the original graph are preserved. 
d
d KW: graphics
d KW: scheme
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260825
d
d Author: Sam Sturm,  Johns Hopkins University
d Support: email ssturm@@jhu.edu
d
f factsheetplot.ado
f factsheetplot.sthlp
f factsheetplot_example.do
f ../s/scheme-factsheetplot.scheme
